      "id": "claim_c54cf5f71c344be198c45ebe93b3ba01",
      "statement": "The MCP server registers each page/action tool via McpServer.registerTool, and every such tool exposes optional string browserInstanceId and tabId inputs that are normalized and forwarded into the request envelope.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/src/mcp-server.ts#L534-L546",
