      "statement": "BrijioBackgroundController dispatches incoming envelopes by type to adapter handlers and extracts tabId by parsing message.target.tabId (string to a safe integer), passing it as a number to page-context, page-content, action, batch, and navigation handlers; open_tab and list_tabs do not take a tabId.",
